      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/77aa72/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-24T04:32:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And you can't get to the button to reassign a hero with where the cat window is now on the iPad. Just found that out when playing a game and someone got disconnected and was temporarily reassigned (via the disconnect window that comes up). When the player came back, I wasn't able to give them back control, as it doesn't automatically give them their hero back, and I couldn't get to the button. I take it there is no other way to reassign heroes?</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
