      "raw": "<p>And you can&#39;t get to the button to reassign a hero with where the cat window is now on the iPad. Just found that out when playing a game and someone got disconnected and was temporarily reassigned (via the disconnect window that comes up). When the player came back, I wasn&#39;t able to give them back control, as it doesn&#39;t automatically give them their hero back, and I couldn&#39;t get to the button. I take it there is no other way to reassign heroes?</p>",
